          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "શાણું — śāṇũ — \"wise; discreet\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "શાણો માણસ ગુસ્સામાં કંઈ બોલતો નથી. śāṇo māṇas gussāmā̃ kãī bolto nathī. A wise man says nothing in anger."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "શાણું (śāṇũ) goes back to a reconstructed sajāna-, \"clever\"; CDIAL lists the Gujarati word, \"wise, discreet, courteous\" (CDIAL 13088)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
