              "text": "ગાંઠવું — gā̃ṭhvũ — \"to heed; to pay attention to (someone)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "તોફાની દીકરો કોઈનું ગાંઠતો નથી. tophānī dīkro koīnũ gā̃ṭhto nathī. The naughty son heeds no one."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with તેણે (he or she …): તેણે કોઈનું ન ગાંઠ્યું, teṇe koīnũ na gā̃ṭhyũ."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ગાંઠવું (gā̃ṭhvũ) is inherited from Sanskrit granthayati, \"ties\"; CDIAL lists the Gujarati verb, \"to tie\" (CDIAL 4353), and Gujarati also uses it, mostly with a negative, for heeding someone."
            }
          ]
        },
